=== escaping quotation ===
PASS: an escaped quotation forces a cell after its frame popped
PASS: the first force publishes
PASS: a second call reads the published value
=== spawned task ===
PASS: a spawned task forces a cell whose frame popped
=== recursion ===
PASS: each activation owns its own cell
=== tail call out of a frame ===
PASS: a word tail calling a cell out of its defining frame
=== value reaches a container ===
PASS: a cell whose value holds a closure over the cell
=== word info ===
PASS: a kept word info array holds its once body after the frame popped
